flowchart TB
Reader[Documentation reader] --> Public[Vercel docs.onesa.eu]
Public --> Allow[Allowlisted public build diagrams search and downloads]
Engineer[Approved engineer] --> Portal[Onesa Portal - emailed link or registered password]
Portal --> Policy[Exact approved email membership - separate Access policy]
Policy --> Token[Signed Access assertion]
Token --> Worker[Deployed Pages fail-closed JWT verifier]
Worker --> Private[Separate internal pages diagrams assets indexes and PDFs]
Anonymous[Anonymous wrong audience forged token or disallowed host] --> Denied[Deny before accessing assets]
Anonymous --> Worker
Origin[pages.dev direct domains preview aliases and custom host] --> Worker
Missing[Missing server bindings or unavailable identity] --> Denied
Source[Public Git repositories] --> Boundary[Hosted access protection does not make committed source confidential]
